      q: "A 44-year-old man is hospitalized with multiple injuries following a motor vehicle collision. An arteriovenous fistula created by an injury would most likely result in which of the following changes to the left ventricular pressure-volume loop? Solid line = preinjury Dashed line = postinjury",
