      q: "A 34-year-old man is evaluated due to dyspnea. The patient undergoes complete pulmonary function testing as well as lung volume measurements. His pulmonary volume curve (blue line) is compared with a normal individual's curve (black line) in the illustration below: Which of the following measures is increased in this patient?",
