      q: "A 54-year-old missionary traveling alone in a remote region of Southern Asia becomes lost. After several days, he arrives at a small village. However, he has gone 24 hours without food or water, and his urine osmolarity is 1150 mOsm/L. The majority of the total amount of water filtered by this individual's glomeruli is reabsorbed in which of the following portions of the nephron?",
